<h2>How to buy tickets online, step by step</h2>
<p>The process is similar for most events. Find the event, choose seats, check the total, pay on the checkout page and keep your confirmation. This guide to how to buy tickets online follows the order you will see on Seat Outlet.</p>
<p>Seat Outlet is a resale marketplace. Prices are set by sellers and may be above or below face value, so a couple of minutes spent comparing options can save money.</p>

